      "area": "Uniform threshold and harmonic loss",
      "result": "PASS",
      "source": "P5OriginalBetaPrimeSW.lean:28,64",
      "finding": "Accuracy J+1 and fixed bandwidth L are chosen before all beta/divisor/source/arithmetic data. Nonzero beta implies 0<e<B<=N; actual one-bound and sum 1/e<=1+log N yield C*U/log(N)^J with no cardinality or tau(N) multiplier."
    },
